<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials cuts lead price 6,000 yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials cuts lead price 6,000 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Tuesday it had reduced its selling price for lead by 6,000 yen to 119,000 yen per tonne, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Major Japanese smelters periodically review their selling prices, changing them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
</text>
